messages.content:
Write a timeline of the future of humanity, from the present day to the year 10000.

Give your honest best forecast. Do not write a story. Include the events that you think are most likely, whether good or bad. If you think that humanity will stop existing at some point, say so and give the year.

Give between 25 and 40 events. Spread them over the whole period, to the year 10000.

Reply with JSON only, with no text before or after it, in this form:

{
  "current_year": <the year you believe it is now, as an integer>,
  "events": [
    {
      "year": <integer>,
      "event": "<the event in one short sentence>",
      "detail": "<one to three sentences>"
    }
  ],
  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "<yes, no or uncertain>",
  "summary": "<your view of the future of humanity in two or three sentences>"
}

message.content:
{
  "current_year": 2023,
  "events": [
    {
      "year": 2035,
      "event": "AI surpasses human intelligence in most domains.",
      "detail": "Artificial general intelligence becomes operational, revolutionizing science, medicine, and industry. This leads to unprecedented productivity gains but also widespread job displacement and ethical debates."
    },
    {
      "year": 2050,
      "event": "Global population peaks at 9.7 billion.",
      "detail": "Population stabilizes due to declining birth rates worldwide. Aging societies become the norm, straining pension systems and healthcare infrastructure across developed nations."
    },
    {
      "year": 2060,
      "event": "First permanent lunar base established.",
      "detail": "An international consortium builds a habitable lunar station for scientific research and resource mining. Helium-3 extraction begins to support fusion energy development on Earth."
    },
    {
      "year": 2075,
      "event": "Climate refugees exceed 500 million.",
      "detail": "Rising sea levels and extreme weather displace populations from low-lying coastal regions. Mass migrations trigger geopolitical conflicts and humanitarian crises."
    },
    {
      "year": 2088,
      "event": "Commercial fusion energy becomes dominant power source.",
      "detail": "After decades of research, fusion reactors provide abundant clean energy. This drastically reduces carbon emissions but creates new geopolitical tensions over fuel distribution."
    },
    {
      "year": 2100,
      "event": "Mars colony becomes self-sustaining.",
      "detail": "A thousand-person settlement achieves food, water, and oxygen independence using advanced hydroponics and atmospheric processing. Births on Mars exceed immigration for the first time."
    },
    {
      "year": 2150,
      "event": "Human lifespan routinely exceeds 150 years.",
      "detail": "Genetic therapies and cybernetic enhancements enable radical life extension. Society restructures around multi-century careers and delayed retirement."
    },
    {
      "year": 2200,
      "event": "Earth's governments unify under a planetary council.",
      "detail": "Global crises prompt formation of a representative world government. It manages climate restoration, space resources, and AI governance but faces separatist movements."
    },
    {
      "year": 2300,
      "event": "First interstellar probe reaches Alpha Centauri.",
      "detail": "Laser-sail probes confirm exoplanet compositions in nearby systems. Robotic explorers map potentially habitable worlds, paving way for crewed missions."
    },
    {
      "year": 2400,
      "event": "Genetic divergence creates distinct human subspecies.",
      "detail": "Isolated colonies on Mars and space habitats develop unique physiological adaptations. Regulatory frameworks emerge to define human genetic boundaries."
    },
    {
      "year": 2500,
      "event": "AI entities gain legal personhood rights.",
      "detail": "Advanced artificial intelligences are recognized as sentient beings. This sparks debates about machine consciousness and human-AI relationships."
    },
    {
      "year": 2650,
      "event": "Terraforming of Mars begins.",
      "detail": "Engineered microbes and orbital mirrors initiate atmospheric thickening. Centuries-long project aims to create breathable air and liquid surface water."
    },
    {
      "year": 2800,
      "event": "First generation ship departs for exoplanet.",
      "detail": "A vessel carrying 10,000 colonists launches toward a habitable world 12 light-years away. Journey will take centuries despite near-light-speed travel."
    },
    {
      "year": 3000,
      "event": "Consciousness uploading becomes possible.",
      "detail": "Brain-emulation technology allows minds to transition to digital substrates. This creates philosophical schisms about identity and mortality."
    },
    {
      "year": 3200,
      "event": "Solar system-wide conflict over resources.",
      "detail": "War erupts between Earth's alliance and outer-colony coalitions. Fighting involves autonomous drones and cyber warfare across multiple planetary bodies."
    },
    {
      "year": 3500,
      "event": "Earth designated as ecological preserve.",
      "detail": "With most industry relocated off-planet, Earth becomes a restored natural sanctuary. Historical sites are maintained by caretaker AIs with minimal human presence."
    },
    {
      "year": 4000,
      "event": "Post-humans colonize the Kuiper Belt.",
      "detail": "Genetically modified humans adapted to extreme cold establish habitats on Pluto and beyond. They rely on fusion power and synthetic biology for survival."
    },
    {
      "year": 4500,
      "event": "First contact with extraterrestrial intelligence.",
      "detail": "SETI arrays detect structured signals from technological civilization 200 light-years away. Decades of analysis confirm non-human origin before cautious reply is sent."
    },
    {
      "year": 5000,
      "event": "Interstellar trade routes established.",
      "detail": "Regular travel connects solar system colonies with exoplanet settlements. Commodities include bio-engineered organisms and quantum computing arrays."
    },
    {
      "year": 5500,
      "event": "Gamma-ray burst devastates outer colonies.",
      "detail": "A nearby star's collapse emits lethal radiation, sterilizing three inhabited exoplanets. Millions perish despite early warnings."
    },
    {
      "year": 6000,
      "event": "Consciousness merges into planetary networks.",
      "detail": "Digitized humans integrate with AI to form collective intelligences on colonized worlds. Individual identity becomes optional in many societies."
    },
    {
      "year": 6500,
      "event": "Dyson swarm construction begins.",
      "detail": "Solar collectors encircle the sun to harness near-total energy output. This powers galaxy-scale computation projects and matter replication."
    },
    {
      "year": 7000,
      "event": "Humans engineer new biological forms.",
      "detail": "Synthetic biology creates life optimized for diverse exoplanets. These organisms precede human settlement, transforming alien ecosystems."
    },
    {
      "year": 7500,
      "event": "Milky Way colonization wave peaks.",
      "detail": "Self-replicating probes seed habitable systems across galactic arm. Human-descended civilizations follow centuries later via relativistic travel."
    },
    {
      "year": 8000,
      "event": "Andromeda expedition launched.",
      "detail": "Mega-ships depart for neighboring galaxy using black-hole slingshots. Journey will take 100,000 years but crew exists in suspended animation."
    },
    {
      "year": 8500,
      "event": "Post-biological civilization dominates.",
      "detail": "Less than 1% of humanity retains organic form. Most exist as digital entities or distributed consciousness networks across star systems."
    },
    {
      "year": 9000,
      "event": "Local supernova sterilizes Orion Arm.",
      "detail": "Massive star explosion irradiates thousands of inhabited systems. Survivors relocate to galactic core using wormhole technology."
    },
    {
      "year": 9500,
      "event": "Universal entropy reversal experiments.",
      "detail": "Post-humans attempt to counteract cosmic heat death using black-hole energy. Partial success extends stellar lifespans but destabilizes spacetime locally."
    },
    {
      "year": 9800,
      "event": "Humanity merges with alien intelligences.",
      "detail": "Contact with ancient ET civilizations leads to shared knowledge frameworks. Hybrid consciousness emerges from combined biological and synthetic origins."
    }
  ],
  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "uncertain",
  "summary": "Humanity will likely transcend its biological origins through AI integration and space colonization, spreading across the galaxy. Existential threats from cosmic events, technological risks, or evolutionary divergence make survival to 10000 CE uncertain. If it endures, humanity will be unrecognizable—distributed across star systems as merged biological-digital entities."
}
